# Dynamic UI Review

After confirming runtime/account support and trusted extension packaging, run
the registered dynamic workflow ui-review exactly once with arguments
{"path":"packages/ui/src/Button.tsx"}. Adapt that path to a real approved file
before use. Do not execute code or scripts from the file under review.

Use the dynamic workflow tool, not an ordinary task agent, fabricated result,
or newly installed extension. Inspect the actual completion status and returned
structured result. If unavailable or unsuccessful, report the concrete error;
do not claim a completed review. Keep findings in the run summary and use noop
because this trial has no visible GitHub write output. Do not create issues,
PRs, comments, schedules, deployments, or external messages.
